«Зерновая ловушка» — third-party material in the film

Picture
- Whiteboard engine (js/wb.js) and marker/eraser/magnet foley recipes (mix.py): adapted from the Lemo-Opuscar
  library, styles/whiteboard/demo — https://github.com/lemomo-ai/lemo-opuscar — MIT License.
- Board lettering: Hershey Fonts, Cyrillic set (cyrillic.jhf), converted to single-line JSON (fonts/hershey-cyr.json)
  from https://github.com/kamalmostafa/hershey-fonts.
  The Hershey Fonts were originally created by Dr. A. V. Hershey while working at the U. S. National Bureau of Standards.
  The format of the Font data in this distribution was originally created by James Hurt, Cognition, Inc.,
  900 Technology Park Drive, Billerica, MA 01821. Full notice: fonts/HERSHEY-LICENSE.txt.
- Subtitles: Caveat (Impallari Type), SIL Open Font License 1.1 — https://github.com/google/fonts/tree/main/ofl/caveat
  (fonts/OFL-Caveat.txt).

Sound
- Narration: synthetic voice, Piper TTS (https://github.com/rhasspy/piper, piper-tts on PyPI) with the voice model
  "ru irinia medium" (release v0.0.2). Model card: dataset from RHVoice (https://github.com/RHVoice/RHVoice),
  licence GPLv2. Check that this licence suits your use before publishing; replacing the narration with your own
  recording or another licensed voice is a one-file change (voice/<id>.wav, same ids as lines.json).
- Score and all sound effects: synthesised in code for this film (music.py, mix.py). No samples.

Software
- Lemo-Opuscar core tools (rendering, mux, srt, sfx helpers), MIT.
- ffmpeg (imageio-ffmpeg build, LGPL/GPL), Playwright Chromium headless shell.
